  {
    "external_id": "rss:529ae5e1238aa75f",
    "title": "I am once more calling on Firefox to stop shipping AI slop",
    "source": "rss",
    "source_url": "https://lobste.rs/s/hgguqc/i_am_once_more_calling_on_firefox_stop",
    "feed_url": "https://lobste.rs/t/ai.rss",
    "published_at": "Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:24:10 -0600",
    "collected_at": "2026-11-21T15:41:30+00:00",
    "content": "<p>I turned off the last round of AI slopper-isms in my Firefox UI, but they keep inviting more of themselves in!</p> <p>Now it's the URL input, which has a glowing loading progress bar to scream \"LOOK AT ME LOOK AT ME LOOK AT ME\"</p> <p>Evidently it wasn't enough when the progress bar was just there so that I could see progress, no it and the slop-cannon human that shit this out onto me made a decision that it should scream for attention.</p> <p>And by the way, this is clearly part of the \"nova\" (aka unicorn vom) UI, which I have completely disabled by feature flag.</p> <p>...idunno, next they can add a white glowing halo around each character of white text so that the page really \"pops\"?</p> <p>If in the AI era taste is the differentiator, so why is there so much evidence of poor taste abounding? The evidence is that the clowns building this see their job as to extract attention from me.</p> <p>They want me to be impressed by their glowing bar, but instead by nailing home the lesson that they don't work in service of my best interests they have left me glowering.</p> <p>Please let me <a href=\"https://slopstrap.mikelacher.com/\" rel=\"ugc\">get off</a> this <a href=\"https://www.geoffreylitt.com/2025/03/03/the-nightmare-bicycle.html\" rel=\"ugc\">nightmare bicycle</a></p>",
    "source_tags": [],
    "feed_name": "Lobsters AI/ML",
    "category": "综合技术"
  },
